    text: The First Responder was told Paul and Peter had been drinking here with
      John. The nearby vendor found John and called the police; he says he saw Peter
      leave around two. Neither he nor the First Responder witnessed the attack,
      so we still need to check those accounts.
    duration: 20
    priority: 1
    skippable: 1
    replaceBehavior: 0
    notes: IOC SOCO procedural milestone; no forensic findings.
  - id: IOC_SOCO_03
    category: 0
    type: 0
    speaker: IOC
    text: I've requested your assistance through operations and submitted the completed
      CSI Form 2 to your team leader. The scene's ready for you to take over the
      investigation. The First Responder will help maintain scene security.
    duration: 20
    priority: 1
    skippable: 1
    replaceBehavior: 0
    notes: IOC SOCO procedural milestone; no forensic findings.
