  - id: closeout-start
    category: 16
    type: 0
    speaker: Professor
    text: Before scene processing is finished, the team checks that every collected
      item and sample is documented and accounted for. This helps prevent evidence
      from being left behind, misplaced or separated from its records. Review the
      evidence inventory before the final survey.
    duration: 11
    priority: 2
    skippable: 1
    replaceBehavior: 0
    notes: Once-per-session training concept, routed by ProceduralTrainingGuidance.
  - id: closeout-survey-guidance
    category: 16
    type: 0
    speaker: Professor
    text: Before leaving the scene, the team conducts a final check to make sure
      required documentation is complete and nothing important has been overlooked.
      Complete the final scene survey before reporting to the IOC.
    duration: 11
    priority: 2
    skippable: 1
    replaceBehavior: 0
    notes: Once-per-session training concept, routed by ProceduralTrainingGuidance.
  - id: closeout-survey-done
